 ng for leading acting roles\, unattainable for actors of color. Unexpected
 ly\, Mo's agent Steven rings\, offering a sudden audition that carries lif
 e-altering potential. During his journey to the audition\, a misunderstand
 ing arises when a biased woman onboard misconstrues Mo's actions as prayer
  and suspects a forgotten bag. In a swift turn\, Mo's world descends into 
 a Kafkaesque nightmare of terror.\n\nStarring: Amir El-Masry\, July Namir\
