 \, Comedy\n\nReturning to cinemas in 2027. In 1964\, Richard Burton\, newl
 y married to Elizabeth Taylor\, is to play the title role in an experiment
 al new Broadway production of Hamlet under Sir John Gielgud’s exacting dir
 ection. But as rehearsals progress\, two ages of theatre collide and the c
 ollaboration between actor and director soon threatens to unravel.\n\nStar
